<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">1 Corintenji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Prota Epistolã Cãtrã Corintenji</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Corintenji</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Cor</para>
  <para style="mt1">Prota Epistolã Cãtrã Corintenji</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Pavlu, acljimat apostul al Hristos Isus prit vrearea al Dumnidzãu, sh-fratili Sosten, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />a bisearicãljei a Dumnidzãlui tu Corintu, atsilor cai suntu sãmtsãsits tu Hristolu Isus sh-acljimats s-hibã populu a lui sãmtu, deadun cu tuts atselji cai acljeamã numa a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos iutsido, Domnul a lor sh-a nostru:<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Har pri voi sh-pace di la Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a nostru, sh-di la Domnul Isus Hristos.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hãristisiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Hãristisescu Dumnidzãlu a meu totãna trã voi trã itia a harului a Dumnidzãlui tsi vã si deadi a voauã tu Hristos Isus. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Cã voi vã avutsãt tu elu tu tuti, tu cathi zbor sh-tu cathi shtintsã, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />ashãtsi di cum s-alihipsi mãrtiria al Hristos ntrã voi, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />ahãt cãt a voauã s-nu vã lipseascã vãrã doarã duhuroasã, ashtiptãnda cu niarãvdari discupirirea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">va s-dzãcã turnarea a Domnului Isus. </char></note> a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Elu va s-vã nvãrtusheascã pãnã tu soni tra s-hits nivãrghits tu dzua a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Pistimen easti Dumnidzãlu, prit cai vã acljimat tu mpriunari cu Hiljilu a lui Isus Hristos, Domnul a nostru.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dispãrtsãri tu Bisearicã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Tora vã acljem, frats sh-surãri, prit numa a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos, tra si zburãts tuts unã soi shi s-nu aibã dispãrtsãri ntrã voi, ma s-hits tuts deadun pi unã minti sh-cu unã nãeti. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Cã nji si featsi cunuscut, frats sh-surãri a melji, di atselji di casa al Cloe, cã ntrã voi ari ngrãnji. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Voi s-vã dzãc aestã, cathi unu di voi dzãtsi: “Mini escu al Pavlu”, “Mini escu al Apollo”, “Mini escu al Chefa”, iarã “Mini escu al Hristos.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Vahi easti mpãrtsãt Hristolu? Nacã Pavlu s-crutsisi trã voi? Nacã vã pãtidzat tu numa al Pavlu? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Hãristisescu Dumnidzãlu tsi nu pãtidzai vãrã di voi, dicãt singur Crispu sh-Gaiu, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />tra s-nu dzãcã vãrã cã s-pãtidzã tu numa a mea. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Pãtidzai sh-oaminjlji di casa al Stefanu, nafoarã di aeshti nu shtiu cã am pãtidzat vãrã. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Cã Hristolu nu mi pitricu s-pãtedz, ma s-dimãndu Evanghelu, nu cu mintimeniljea a zborlui tra s-nu armãnã fãrã di puteari crutsea al Hristos.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hristolu, Mintimeniljea sh-Fuchia a Dumnidzãlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Cã zborlu a crutsiljei easti zurleatsã ti atselji tsi cheru, iarã ti noi tsi nã ascãpãm easti putearea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Cã easti scriatã: “Va u-cher mintimeniljea a mintimenjilor, shi achicãsirea a shtiutslor va u-afãnisescu.” <verse eid="1CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Iu easti mintimenlu? Iu easti scriblu? Iu easti filozoflu a etiljei aishtei? Nu u-featsi zurlã Dumnidzãlu mintimeniljea a lumiljei aishtei? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Cã metsi tu mintimeniljea a Dumnidzãlui, lumea nu l-cunuscu Dumnidzãlu prit mintimeniljea a ljei, lji arsi al Dumnidzãu s-lji ascapã atselji cai pistipsescu prit zurleatsa a predicariljei. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Cã Iudeilji caftã seamni sh-Elinji caftã mintimenilji, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />ma noi predicãm Hristolu crutsisit, di unã parti cheatra di nchidicari trã Iudeilji sh-di alantã parti zurleatsã trã Pãngãnjlji. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Iarã trã atselji acljimatslji, cum Iudei sh-cum Elinji, Hristolu easti putearea sh-mintimeniljea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Cã zurleatsa a Dumnidzãlui easti ma mintimenã dicãt mintimeniljea a oaminjlor, shi slãbintsa al Dumnidzãu easti ma vãrtoasã dicãt putearea a oaminjlor. <verse eid="1CO 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Videts, frats sh-surãri, acljimarea a voastrã, cã nu earats multsã di voi mintimenji dupã trup, nu earats multsã di voi vãrtoshi, nu earats multsã di voi di soi nobilã. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ma Dumnidzãlu aleapsi lucrili atseali zurli a lumiljei tra s-arushineadzã mintimenjilji, sh-Dumnidzãlu aleapsi atseali nipututili a lumiljei tra si arushineadzã vãrtoshlji. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Dumnidzãlu aleapsi lucrili cai nu suntu nobili, dispretsuiti sh-atseali cai nu suntu tsiva, tsi s-afãniseascã atseali tsi suntu axiusiti dupã lumea, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />tsi vãrã s-nu si s-alavdã nãintea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ma di la elu voi hits tu Hristolu Isus, cai s-featsi trã noi mintimenilji di la Dumnidzãlu, ndriptati, sãmtsãri sh-arãscumpãrari, <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />cã, ashãtsi cum easti scriatã, “Atsel tsi s-alavdã, prindi si s-alavdã tu Domnul.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Preadicã Mintimeniljea al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Cãndu mini vinj la voi, frats sh-surãri, nu zburai cu zboari mãri icã ca mintimen trã dimãndari a voauã mistiryiul al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Cã apofãsii s-nu shtiu altu tsiva ntrã voi, dicãt Isus Hristolu sh-aestu crutsisit. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Mini vinj la voi cu slãbintsã, cu fricã sh-cu trimurari mari. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Zborlu a meu sh-predicarea a mea nu furã zboari di cãndãrsiri prit mintimeniljea, ma cu aspunearea a Duhlui sh-a fuchiiljei, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />tsi pistea a voastrã s-nu s-andoapir tu mintimeniljea umineascã, ma tu putearea a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mintimeniljea a Dumnidzãlui Aspusã prit Duh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Cu tut atsea noi zburãm ti mintimeniljea ntrã oaminji coptsã, ma nu ti mintimeniljea a lumiljei sh-a frãmtashilor a lumiljei aishtei, atsilor cai ma cher. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Din contra, noi grim mintimeniljea al Dumnidzãu, tu mistiryiul tsi fu ascumtu, cai Dumnidzãlu u-arãdãpsi nãinti di tuti etili trã mãrirea a noastrã. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Aestã vãrã di domnjitorlji a etiljei aishtei nu u-ari aduchitã, cã, macã va u avea aduchitã, nu va lu-avea crutsisitã Domnul a mãririljei. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ma ashã cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Atseali tsi ocljiul nu li vidzu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">sh-ureaclja nu li avdzã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">sh-tsi nu intrarã tu inima a omlui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">suntu atseali tsi etimãsi Dumnidzãlu trã atselji cai lu vor.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />A noauã nã li discupiri Dumnidzãlu prit Duhlu, cã Duhlu li sitãxeashti tuti, sh-ahãndamili al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Cai di oaminjlji li shtii minduirili a omlui, dicãt duhlu a omlui tsi easti tu nãsu? Ashãtsi sh-minduirili al Dumnidzãu nu li shtii vãrã di cãt Duhlu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Noi nu lom duhlu a lumiljei, ma Duhlu tsi easti di la Dumnidzãlu, tra s-cunushtem atseali tsi nã deadi prit har Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Trã atsea noi zburãm, nu cu zboari nvitsati di la mintimeniljea a oaminjlor, ma cu zboari nvitsati di la Duhlu, sitãxinda lucrili duhuroasi a oaminjlor duhuroshi. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Omlu natural nu li aproachi lucrili a Duhlui a Dumnidzãlui, cã trã nãsu suntu zurleatsã sh-nu poati s-li aducheascã, cã atseali suntu sitãxiti prit Duh. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Omlu duhuros li sitãxeashti tuti, ma elu nu si sitãxeashti di vãrã, <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />cã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Cai u cunuscu mintea a Domnului,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">tra s-lu nveatsã atsel?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Ma noi avem mintea a Hristolui.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Orixili a Truplui ti Duc tu Dispãrtsãri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Mini frats sh-surãri, nu putui si zburãscu cu voi ca oaminji duhuroshi, ma zburai cu voi ca oaminji trupeshti, ca cilimenjlji njitsi tu Hristos. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Vã hrãni cu lapti, nu cu mãcãri vãrtoasi, cã ninga nu putets s-u ascãpitats. Meti sh-tora nu putets, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />cã ninga hits oaminji trupeshti. Cã pãn-cãndu ntrã voi ari zilii sh-ngrãnji, nu hits sh-voi trupeshti sh-nu ma imnats ca oaminji? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Cã cãndu un dzãtsi, “Mini escu al Pavlu,” iarã un altu dzãtsi, “Mini escu al Apollo,” nu hits tuts oaminji? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Cai easti Apollo? Sh-cai easti Pavlu? Huzmichearlji prit cai pistipsitã, ashã dupã cum Domnul lji deadi a cathiunui. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Mini siminai, Apollo adãpã, iarã Dumnidzãlu featsi crishtearea. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Ashãtsi cã, nu easti tsiva nitsi atsel tsi seaminã, nitsi atsel tsi adapã, ma mash Dumnidzãlu tsi fatsi crishtearea. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Atsel tsi seaminã sh-atsel tsi adapã suntu unã soi sh-cathiunu va ljea arãsplata a lui dupã lucrul a lor. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Cã noi him colucrãtori a Dumnidzãlui, voi hits agrulu al Dumnidzãu, adãrãmintul al Dumnidzãu.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Dupã harul al Dumnidzãu tsi nji si deadi, ca un mastru mintimen, mini bãgai timeljiu, iarã un altu adari di prisupru. Cathi unu prindi s-adarã cu cãshtigã, <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />cã vãrã nu poati s-bagã altu timeljiu, dicãt atsel tsi easti bãgat, cai easti Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Tora, macã vãrã adarã pri aestu timeljiu ufilisinda furii, asimi, chetri scumpi, leamni, iarbã, palji, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />lucrulu a cathiunui va easã tu padi, cã Dzua va l-facã si s-veadã, cã va s-dizvãleascã cu foc sh-foclu va s-aspunã cai easti lucrul a cathiunui. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Macã lucrul a vãrui tsi elu adãrã prisuprã va armãnã, elu va ljea arãsplata. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Macã lucrul a vãrui va si s-ardã tutã, elu va s-u chearã lucrul, ma atsel om va si ascapã ashã ca prit foc.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Nu shtits cã hits templul al Dumnidzãu sh-cã Duhlu a Dumnidzãlui bãneadzã tu voi? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Macã vãrã va aspargã templul a Dumnidzãlui, Dumnidzãlu va lu aspargã atsel om, cã templul a Dumnidzãlui, tsi hits voi, easti sãmtu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Vãrã s-nu si s-arãdã. Macã vãrã di voi mindueashti cã easti mintimen tu aestã etã, si s-facã “zurlu,” tra si s-facã mintimen. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Cã mintimeniljea a lumiljei aishtei easti zurleatsã nãintea al Dumnidzãu, cã easti scriatã: “Elu lji acatsã mintimenjilji tu ileili a lor.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Sh-iarã: “Domnul li cunoashti minduirili a mintimenjilor tsi suntu goali.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Trã atsea, vãrã s-nu si s-alavdã cu oaminjlji, cã tuti suntu a voastri, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />cum Pavlu, cum Apollo, cum Chefa, cum lumea, cum bana, cum moartea, cum atseali tsi suntu di azã, sh-atseali tsi va yinã, tuti suntu a voastri, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />sh-voi hits a Hristolui, sh-Hristolu easti al Dumnidzãu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Huzmichearlji sh-Administratorlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Cathiunu prindi s-nã lugurseascã ashãtsi: ca huzmicheari al Hristos sh-ca administratori a mistiryilor a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Administratorlu prindi s-hibã pistimen. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Trã mini, nu mi mealã tsiva cã mi giudicã di voi icã di giudicata umineascã. Meti, sh-idyiul mini nu mi giudic. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Cã, nu escu conshtient ti tsiva contra di mini, cu tut-atsea nu escu dizcãbãtsit trã aestã itii, ma atsel tsi mi giudicã easti Domnul. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Trã atsea nu giudicats tsiva nãinti di oara, pãn-cãndu s-yinã Domnul, cai va scoatã tu lunjinã ascumtili a ntuneariclui sh-va s-aspunã minduirili a ininjilor sh-atumtsea alãvdarea va lji yinã a cathiunui di la Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Tora, frats sh-surãri, aesti li ligai cu mini sh-cu Apollo, ti ghinea a voastrã, tsi prit noi s-nvitsats atsea tsi: “S-nu njidzets ma nclo di atsea cai easti scriatã,” tsi vãrã s-nu si s-alavdã contra alãntui trã hãtãrea a unui altu. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Cã, cai ti aleadzi tini di alantsã? Sh-tsi ai tini tsi nu u loash? Ma, sh-macã u loash, cãtse ti alavdzã sh-dzãts cã nu u loash? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Tora hits fãnãtits! Tora vã avutsãt! Vã featsit amiradzi fãrã di noi! Sh-macar dealihea s-vã fãtseat amiradzi tsi sh-noi s-domneam deadun cu voi! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Cã minduescu cã Dumnidzãlu nã aspusi noi apostulji ca atselji di ma nãpoi a tutulor, ca condamnats cu moarti, cã nã featsim trã arãdearea a lumiljei, trã anghilji sh-trã oaminjlji. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Noi him zurlji trã hãtãrea al Hristos, iarã voi hits mintimenji ntru Hristolu, noi him slaghi, iarã voi vãrtoshi, voi hits tinjisits sh-noi nitinjisits! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Pãnã tu aestã oarã noi avem sh-foami, avem sh-seati, him ninviscuts, him multu bãtuts sh-him fãrã casã, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />sh-nã munduim lucrãnda cu mãnjili a noastri. Hinda ngiurats, noi ghinicuvãntãm, hinda priaĝunits, noi arãvdãm, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />hinda pizuits, nã apãndisim cu bunã. Nã featsim pãnã tora ca lãvushiturili a lumiljei sh-ca cupria a tutulor.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Prispunearea al Pavlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Nu ma lã scriu aesti tra s-vã arushinedz, ma ma vã vãrghescu ca cilimenjlji a melji vruts. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Cã, sh-macã va avets dzatsi njilji di nvitsãtori tu Hristolu, cu tutã aestã nu avets multsã pãrintsã, cã mini vã amintai tu Hristolu Isus prit evanghelu. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Trã atsea vã fac rigeai s-vã fãtsets imitatorlji a melji. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Trã aestã pitricui la voi Timoteu, hiljiu a meu vrut sh-pistimen tu Domnu, cai va vã aducã-aminti cãljurili a meali tu Hristolu Isus, ashãtsi di cum li nvets iutsido tu cathi bisearicã. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Niscãntsã di voi s-alãvdarã, canda nu va yinea ma la voi. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Sh-va yin trãoarã la voi, ma s-va Domnul, sh-va cunoscu nu mash zborlu atsilor cai suntu alãvdats, ma sh-fuchia a lor. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Cã nu sta tu zbor amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu, ma tu fuchii. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Tsi vrets? S-yin la voi cu veargã icã cu vreari sh-cu duhlu a frunimeatsiljei?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Omlu Atsel Amãrtios s-Mitãnjiuseascã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Iutsido s-avdi cã ntrã voi ari putãnlichi, sh-un ahtar putãnlichi tsi nu s-aflã shi ntrã pãngãnjlji, s-ari dus pãnã aclo cãt un doarmi cu muljearea a tatã-sui. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Sh-voi hits pirifãnsits sh-nu vã nvirinat shi s-afãniseascã dit mesea a voastrã atsel cai featsi aestu lucru? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Mini di parta a mea, cu tutã cã nu escu cu trup, ma escu la voi cu duh. Tora am giudicatã atsel cai featsi aestu lucru, canda s-earam atsia. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Tu numa a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos cãndu s-vã adunats voi sh-duhlu a meu cu voi, deadun cu fuchia a Domnului a nostru Isus, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />s-lu pridats ahtar om a Satanlui trã aspãrdzearea a truplui, cu nãeti tsi duhlu s-ascapã tu dzua a Domnului. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Nu easti bunã pirifanjea a voastrã! Nu shtits voi cã putsãnã mãeauã adari tut aloatlu? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Curats-vã di mãeaua atsea veacljea, tra s-hits aloat nou, ashã dupã cum hits fãrã mãeauã, cã sh-Hristolu, Pashtili a nostru, s-curbãnsi. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Trã atsea si-sãrbãtorim nu cu maeaua atsea veaclja sh-nitsi cu maeaua a arãutãtsiljei sh-a slãbintsãljei, ma cu pãni fãrã di mãeauã, chischinã sh-alihioasã.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Vã scriai tu cartea a mea tra s-nu vã misticats cu curvarlji. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Nu easti zborlu dip ti curvarlji a lumiljei aishtei icã ti zilichearlji sh-arãchitorlji, icã ti idulatsri, cã altã soi va lipsea s-isheat di aestã lumi. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Ma tora vã scriai tra s-nu vã misticats cu vãrã tsi s-acljeamã frati, iarã elu easti curvar icã zilichear, idulatru icã blãstimãtor, mbitat icã arãchitor, cu cai nu prindi s-mãcats deadun.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Cã tsi mi mealã mini s-giudic atselji di nafoarã? Nu lji giudicats voi atselji di nãuntru? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Atselji di nafoarã va lji giudic Dumnidzãlu. “Scutets-lu nafoarã arãulu dit mesea a voastrã!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Deut 17:7</char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Giudicãri Namisa di Fratsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Cuteadzã vãrã di voi tsi, cãndu ari unã halã contra a unui altu, si s-giudic nãintea nindreptsãlor sh-nu nãintea a oaminjlor sãmtsã a Dumnidzãlui? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Nu shtits cã oaminjlji sãmtsã a Dumnidzãlui va giudic lumea? Sh-macã lumea va si s-giudic di voi, atumtsea vahi hits anaxi ti giudicari lucrili ma njitsi? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Nu shtits cã va giudicãm anghilji? Sh-cãt ma multu lucrili aishtei lumi? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Trã atsea, ma s-avets niaduchiri trã lucrili a bãnãljei, va bãgats giudicãtori atselji cai suntu nitinjisits tu bisearicã? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Trã arushinea a voastrã vã dzãc. Ashãtsi, nu ari atsia ntrã voi vãrã mintimen, cai va s-poatã s-giudicã namisa di fratslji a lui? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ashãtsi, frati s-giudicã di fratili, sh-aestã nãintea a nipistimenjilor!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Tora, aestã easti didip unã chireari trã voi, faptul tsi avets giudicãtsi cu un-alantu. Cãtse nu alãsats ma ghini s-vã fac nindriptati? Cãtse nu alãsats ma ghini s-vã arãdã? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Din contra, voi fãtsets nindriptati sh-arãdets altsãlji, sh-aestã u-fãtsets la fratslji. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Nacã nu shtits cã nindreptsãlji nu va u-mushtineadzã Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui? Nu vã arãdets! Nitsi curvarlji, nitsi idulatsri, nitsi curunã-cãlcatslji, nitsi imasculatsi sexualã, nitsi atselji tsi s-duc cu mascuri, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />nitsi furlji, nitsi zilichearlji, nitsi mbitatsilji, nitsi blãstimãtorilji, nitsi arãchitorlji nu va u-mushtineadzã Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Sh-ahtãri earats niscãntsã di voi, ma vã aspilat, vã sãmtsãtã, vã ndriptat tu numa a Domnului Isus Hristos sh-prit Duhlu a Dumnidzãlui a nostru.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dipãrtats-vã di Imoralitatea Sexualã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />“Tuti suntu nvoljiti trã mini,” ma nu tuti suntu di ufelii. “Tuti suntu nvoljiti trã mini,” ma mini nu va mi bag tu domniljea a vãrui lucru. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Voi dzãtsets, “Mãcãrili suntu ti pãnticlu sh-pãnticlu easti ti mãcãrili, ma Dumnidzãlu va li afãniseascã sh-atsel sh-aesti.” Iarã truplu nu easti trã putãnsiri, ma trã Domnul sh-Domnul trã truplu. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Dumnidzãlu lu nyie Domnul, sh-noi va nã nyeadzã prit fuchia a lui. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Nu shtits cã trupurili a voastri suntu mãdularili a Hristolui? S-fatsi s-li mut mãdularili a Hristolui shi s-li mpriuneadzã cu mãdularili a unei putanã? Pute s-nu hibã! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Nacã nu shtits cã atsel tsi s-mpriunã cu putana, easti un trup cu ea? Cã Scritura dzãtsi: “Va hibã doilji un trup singur.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahr 2:24</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Iarã atsel tsi s-mpriuneadzã tu Domnul, easti un duh cu nãsu.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Dipãrtats-vã di putãnsirea! Cathi amãrtii, itsido tsi fatsi un om, easti nafoarã di trup, iarã atsel cai putãnseashti, amãrtiseashti cãtrã truplu a lui. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Nacã nu shtits cã truplu a vostru easti templul a Duhlui Sãmtu, tsi easti tu voi, cai lu avets di la Dumnidzãlu sh-voi nu hits a voshtri? <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Cã voi vã acumpãrat cu un tinjii. Multumãrits tora Dumnidzãlu tu truplu a vostru!<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ntribari ti Mãrtarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Anvãrliga di atseali tsi scriat, voi dzãtsets: “Ghini easti ti omlu s-nu cãrteascã muljeari.” <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ma trã itia a putãnsiriljei, cathiunu prindi s-aibã muljearea a lui sh-cathiunã s-aibã bãrbatlu a ljei. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Bãrbatlu si mplineascã ananghili a lui cãtrã muljearea tutashã sh-muljearea cãtrã bãrbatlu a ljei. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Muljearea nu ari puteari pri truplu a ljei, ma ari bãrbatlu a ljei, tutashã sh-bãrbatlu nu ari puteari pri truplu a lui, ma ari muljearea a lui. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Nu vã alipidats a-unui-alantu, dicãt mash cu ghini-achicãsiri, ti un chiro, tsi s-vã rugats sh-nãpoi s-hits deadun, tra s-nu vã cãrteascã Satanlu di itia a nifãrnariljei a voastrã. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Aestã u-dzãc ca volje, nu ca un ordin. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Mini voi tsi tuts oaminjlji s-hibã ashã cum escu mini, ma cathiunu ari doara a lui di la Dumnidzãlu, un ashã sh-alantu altã soi.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Lã dzãc a ninsuratsãlor sh-a veduvilor, cã va eara ghini trã elji ca si armãnã nisurats ashã ca mini. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ma, macã nu pot si s-nfãrneadzã, si nsoarã icã s-mãritã cã easti ma ghini ashãtsi dicãt si s-ardã dit orixili. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Iarã atsilor tsi suntu mãrtats lã ursescu, nu mini, ma Domnul, tsi muljearea s-nu si dispartã di bãrbatlu. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Macã si dispartã, s-armãnã nimãrtatã icã si s-puitueascã cu bãrbatlu sh-bãrbatlu s-nu u-alasã muljearea.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Iarã a alantsãlor lã dzãc, mini, nu Domnul: Macã vãrã frati ari muljeari nipistimenã sh-ea va s-bãneadzã cu nãsu, elu s-nu u-alasã ea. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Sh-macã unã muljeari ari un bãrbat nipistimen sh-aestu va s-bãneadzã cu nãsã, ea s-nu u-alasã bãrbat-su. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Cã bãrbatlu nipistimen easti sãmtsãsit di muljearea sh-muljearea nipistimenã easti sãmtsãsitã di bãrbat-su pistimen, cã altã soi cilimenjlji a voshtri suntu nicurats, iarã tora suntu sãmtsãsits.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ma macã nipistimenlu si mparti, si s-dispartã! Tu aesti situatsii fratili icã sora nu suntu ma ligats, ma Dumnidzãlu nã ari acljimat s-bãnãm tu pace. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Cã tsi shtii tini la, muljeari, vahi va lu ascachi bãrbatlu? Icã tsi shtii tini lai, bãrbate, vahi va u-ascachi muljearea?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bãneadzã Dupã Acljimarea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Cumtsido s-hibã, ashã di cum lji mpãrtsã Domnul a cathiunui, ashã di cum ari acljimat Dumnidzãlu cathiunul, ashã s-imnã. Ashãtsi ursescu la tuti biseritsli. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />S-acljimã vãrã dupã tsi eara anvãrliga-tãljeat? Si nu s-facã nianvãrliga-tãljeat. S-acljimã vãrã, hinda nianvãrliga-tãljeat? S-nu s-anvãrliga-talji. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Anvãrliga-tãljearea nu easti tsiva sh-nianvãrliga-tãljearea nu easti tsiva, ma tsãnearea a dimãndãciunilor al Dumnidzãu s-lugurseashti. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Itsi om prindi s-armãnã tu starea tsi elji eara cãndu Dumnidzãlu li acljimã. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ti acljimash cãndu earai sclav? S-nu ai gaile ti aestã, ma sh-macã pots s-hii liber, ma ghini fã-u aestã. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Cã atsel cai s-acljimã di Domnul hinda sclav, easti liberatlu a Domnului. Tutashã atsel tsi s-acljimã hinda liber, easti sclavlu a Hristolui. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Voi vã acumpãrat cu un tinjii, nu vã fãtsets sclayilji a oaminjlor. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Frats sh-surãri, cathiun s-armãnã nãintea al Dumnidzãu ashã cum eara cãndu s-acljimã.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Trã Nimãrtatsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Cãt di virghinãli nu am vãrã ordin di la Domnul, ma dau minduirea ca om njiluit di Domnul tra s-hiu axiu trã pistipsiri. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Minduescu cã aestã easti ghini trã itia a zurusiriljei di tora, tsi omlu s-armãnã ashãtsi di cum easti. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Eshti ligat cu unã muljeari? Nu caftã s-ti dizledzi. Eshti dizligat di unã muljeari? Nu caftã muljeari. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Ma sh-macã ti nsori, nu amãrtiseshti. Sh-macã unã virghinã s-mãritã, nu amãrtiseashti. Ghini ma aeshti oaminji nsurats va aibã mundueari sh-mini voi s-vã afirescu.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Mini vã dzãc aestã, frats sh-surãri, cã chirolu easti shcurtu sh-di tora sh-nclo prindi tsi sh-atselji tsi au muljeri s-hibã ca atselji tsi nu au muljeri, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />atselji tsi plãngu, canda nu plãngu, atselji tsi hãrsescu, canda nu hãrsescu, atselji tsi acumpãrã, canda nu au tsiva a lor, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />atselji tsi ufilisescu bunili a lumiljei aishtei, canda nu suntu spindzurati di eali, cã forma a lumiljei aishtei ma treatsi.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Mini voi tra s-hits nistuhinats. Ninsuratlu s-cãshtigheadzi ti lucrili a Domnului, cum s-lji arseascã a Domnului, <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />iarã atsel cai easti nsurat, s-cãshtigheadzi ti lucrili a lumiljei, cum s-lji arseascã a muljeariljei <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />sh-easti mpãrtsãt pi doauã. Sh-muljearea atsea nimãrtata sh-virghina s-cãshtigheadzã ti lucrili a Domnului, tra s-hibã sãmti tu trup sh-tu duh. Iarã atsea tsi easti mãrtatã, s-cãstigheadzi ti lucrili a lumiljei, cum s-lji arseascã a bãrbat-lui. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Aestã ma u-dzãc trã ghinea a voastrã, nu tra s-vã bagã tu cearcu, ma trã incurajari a voauã, trã atsea tsi easti ndreaptã shi s-lji huzmitipsim a Domnului deadun.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ma, macã vãrã mindueashti cã ma s-aspuni di arushãni cãtrã virghina a lui,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">virghina a lui va s-dzãc susita lui. </char></note> ma s-hibã cã lji ari tricut chirolu sh-ashã prindi si s-facã, s-facã atsea tsi va sh-nu amãrtiseashti, si nsoarã. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ma cai sta niminat tu inima a lui, fãrã s-hibã strimtã, ma s-aibã puteari pristi vrearea a lui sh-ma s-aibã giudicat aestã tu inima a lui, fatsi ghini s-nu s-mãritã virghina a lui. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Ashãtsi sh-atsel cai u-mãritã virghina a lui, fatsi ghini, iarã sh-atsel tsi nu u-mãritã fatsi sh-ma ghini.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Unã muljeari easti ligat cu bãrbatlu a ljei di cãt chiro elu bãneadzã, iarã, ma s-moarã bãrbatlu a ljei, easti liberã si s-mãritã cu cai va, mash tsi atsel s-hibã tu Domnul. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Ma, dupã minduirea a mea, ea easti ma hãrãcoapã ma s-armãnã ashã cum eara. Ashã minduescu mini cã sh-mini am Duhlu a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mãcari Curbãnsitã a Idoljilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Cãt ti atseali mãcãri curbãnsiti a idoljilor, noi shtim cã “tuts avem cunushteari.” Cunushtearea s-pirifãnseashti, iarã vrearea adari. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Macã a vãrui lji si pari cã ari cunuscut tsiva, nu ari cunuscut ninga ashã cum prindi s-cunoascã. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ma macã vãrã lu va Dumnidzãlu, aestu om easti cunuscut di elu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Cãt ti mãcarea atsea curbãnsitã a idoljilor, shtim cã “un idol nu easti tsiva tu lumi” sh-cã “nu ari vãrã Dumnidzã tu lumi dicãt mash unlu.” <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Cã, sh-macã suntu atselji ashã-acljimats dumnidzadz, cum tu tser, cum tu loc (di cum suntu multsã dumnidzadz sh-multsã domnji), <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />nãpoi sh-nãpoi trã noi easti mash un Dumnidzã, Tatãl, di la cai suntu tuti, sh-noi bãnãm ti nãsu, sh-easti mash un Domnu, Isus Hristos, prit cai suntu adrati tuti sh-noi bãnãm prit nãsu.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Cu tut atsea aestã cunushteari nu easti la tutsã. Niscãntsã, traptã di adetea a idoljilor pãnã tora, cãndu mãcã atsea tsi easti curbãnsita a idolui, conshtintsa a lor hinda slabã, s-pãnĝãneashti. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Mãcarea nu nã aproachi ningã Dumnidzãlu, cã nitsi macã nu mãcãm nu va him ma putsãn, sh-nitsi macã va mãcãm nu va him ma multu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ma bãgats mintea tsi libertatea a voastrã s-nu s-facã nchidicari trã slaghilji. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Cã, macã vãrã tsi easti slab va veadã voi tsi avets cunushteari stãnda ti mãcari la templul a idoljilor, nu va cuteadzã conshtintsa a lui, hinda slab, tsi elu s-mãcã di atseali curbãnsiti a idoljilor? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ashãtsi, atsel cai easti slab, fratili a tãu, trã cai muri Hristolu, va chearã trã itia cunushteariljei a ta. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ashãtsi, amãrtisinda contra a fratsilor sh-pliguinda conshtintsa a lor atsea slabã, amãrtisits cãtrã Hristolu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Trã atsea, macã unã mãcari s-fatsi nchidicari ti fratili a meu, nu va mãcã pute carni nãpoi tra s-nu s-ncheadicã fratili a meu.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ndreaptili a Apostului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Nu escu mini liber? Nu escu mini apostul? Nu lu am vidzut mini Isusul, Domnul a nostru? Nu hits voi faptul a meu tu Domnul? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Macã trã altsãlji nu escu apostul, trã voi fãrã di altã cã escu, cã voi hits vula a apostuliiljei a mea tu Domnul.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Aestã easti apãrarea a mea cãtrã atselji tsi mi giudicã: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Nu avem noi ndriptati s-mãcãm shi s-bem? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Nacã nu avem ndreptul sh-noi s-lom ti muljeari unã sorã, ashã ca alantsã apostulji sh-fratslji a Domnului, sh Chefa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Icã mash mini sh-Barnaba nu avem ndreptul s-nu lucrãm?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Cai s-dutsi vãrãoarã suldat cu pãradzãlji a lui? Cai seaminã unã ayinji sh-nu mãcã carpolu a ljei? Cai pashti unã cupii sh-nu bea di laptili a ljei? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Nacã ma li dzãc aesti ca om. Nu li dzãtsi sh-Legea ashã? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Cã tu Legea al Moisiu easti scriatã: “Nu lji ncljidã gura a boului cãndu alunseashti.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Deut 25:4</char></note> Nacã s-angulceashti Dumnidzãlu trã boilji? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Nacã greashti trã noi, dealihea? Ti noi suntu scriati, cã atsel cai bagã pluglu sh-atsel cai alunseashti prindi s-lucreadzã cu nãdii tra s-ljea birichetea. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Macã noi avem siminat namisa di voi simintsa duhuroasã, easti aestu lucru ahãntu mari, macã sitsirãm noi bunili a voastri materiali di la voi? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Macã altsã au parti la aestu ndreptu pri voi, nu avem sh-noi niheamã ma multu ndreptu? Ma noi nu avem ufilisit atsel ndreptu. Din contra, noi li arãvdãm tuti cu nãeti tra s-nu bãgãm vãrã ncheadic la evanghelu al Hristos. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Nu shtits cã atselji cai facã huzmitipsiri tu templu, mãcã dit hrana a templui sh-atselji cai lj-huzmitipsescu a altarlui, s-facã pãrtashi a altarlui? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ashãtsi sh-Domnul ordinã atselji cai dimãndu evanghelul, s-bãneadzã di la evanghelu.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ma mini nu am ufilisit vãrã di aesti ndrepturi sh-nu li scriai aesti tra si s-facã ashã cu mini, cã easti ma ghini ti mini s-mor, dicãt vãrã s-nji-u aleapid alãvdarea a mea. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Cã, macã dimãndu evanghelul, nu ari ti mini motiv ti alãvdari, cã easti ananghioasã tsi nji easti ngãrcatã sh-meti, cavai di mini, ma nu-lu predicai evanghelul! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Macã aestã u-facã cu bunã-vreari, am unã arãsplatã, ma macã u-facã nu cu bunã-vreari, atumtsea aestã armãni sartsinã cai nji easti pistipsitã. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Cai easti arãsplata a mea? Easti cã, dimãndãnda evanghelul s-lu fac fãrã platã sh-ashãtsi s-nu ufilisescu ndreptul a meu trã evanghelul.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Cã, cu tutã cã escu liber di tuti, mi feciu sclavlu a tutulor, cu nãeti tra s-amintã cãt ma multsã. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ashãtsi mi feciu ca Iudeu cu Iudeilji tra s-amintam Iudei. Atsilor di sum lege, mi feciu ca di sum lege (cu tutã cã nu escu di sum lege), tra s-amintam atselji di sum lege. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Nãintea atsilor tsi suntu fãrã di lege, mi feciu ca fãrã di lege (cu tutã cã nu escu fãrã di legea al Dumnidzãu, ma escu sum legea al Hristos), tsi s-amintam atselji fãrã di lege. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Cu atselji slaghi mi feciu slab, tra s-amintam slaghilji, a tutulor mi feciu itsido, tra s-ascãpam fãrã di altã niscãntsã. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Tuti aesti li fac trã itia al evanghelu, tra s-mi fac pãrtash tu nãsu.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Nu shtits cã atselji tsi alagã tu arenã, dealihea tuts alagã, ma unul va ljea premiul. Alãgats tra s-lu loats. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Caitsido tsi ljea parti tu alãgari, si nfãrneadzã la tuti sh-elji u-facã aestã trã amintari unã curunã cai s-aspardzi, iarã noi va amintãm curuna cai nu s-aspardzi. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Ashãtsi mini alagã, ma nu fãrã nãeti, alumtã, ma nu ca pi vimtu. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Meti, lu nvets truplu a meu cu aspru sh-lu sclãvuescu, tsi dupã tsi am predicat altsilor s-nu armãnã nafoarã di garã discalificat.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Prispuneari di Istoria al Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Frats sh-surãri, mini nu voi tsi voi s-hits nishtiuts, trã atsea cã pãrintsãlji a noshtri furã tuts sum nior sh-tuts tricurã prit amari. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Tuts s-pãtidzarã ntru Moisiul, tu nior sh-tu amari. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Tuts mãcarã dit idyia mãcari sufliteascã, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />sh-tuts biurã dit idyia biuturã sufliteascã, cã biurã dit unã cheatrã sufliteascã tsi lã sotsãsea, sh-atsea cheatrã eara Hristolu. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ma ma multsãlji di elji nu lj-arsirã a Dumnidzãlui, cã trupurili a lor mortsã s-dispãrtsãrã tu irnjii.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Aesti lucri s-featsirã urnechi ti noi, tsi noi s-nu arsim atseali aralili, ashãtsi cum featsirã elji. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Nu vã fãtsets idulatori, ashã ca niscãntsã di elji, di cum easti scriatã: “Populu shidzu ti mãcari sh-ti beari shi si sculã ti giucari.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ex 32:6.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Noi nu prindi s-putãnsim, cum putãnsirã niscãntsã di elji sh-cãdzurã mortsã tu unã dzuã treisprãyinghits di njilji. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Noi nu prindi s-bãgãm tu provã Hristolu, ashãtsi cum lu bãgarã niscãntsã di elji sh-murirã di nãpãrtitsli. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Sh-nu murmurats ashã di cum murmurarã niscãntsã di elji shi s-afãnisirã di anghilu afãnsitoru.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Aesti lucri lã undzirã a lor ca urnechi shi suntu scriati tra s-nã si facã nvitsãturi a noauã cai agiumsim tu bitisita a etilor. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Trã atsea, atsel cai mindueashti cã sta pri cicioari s-aibã cãshtiga s-nu cadã. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Vãrã cãrteari nu vã ari acãtsat voi, dicãt atsea umineascã. Pistimen easti Dumnidzãlu cai nu va vã alasã s-vã cãrtits ma multu di atsea tsi putets, ma deadun cu munduirea va vã da sh-ascãparea tsi voi s-putets s-u arãvdats.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sãrbãtoari ti Idolji sh-Tsina a Domnului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Trã atsea, vrutslji a melji, fudzits di idolatrii. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ma vã grescu ca a mintimenjilor, giudicats voi cã tsi ma vã dzãc. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Cupa a ghinicuvãntariljei tsi noi ghinicuvãntãm, nu easti pãrtashi tu sãndzili a Hristolui? Pãna tsi noi frãndzem, nu easti pãrtashi tu truplu a Hristolui? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Metsi easti unã pãni sh-noi multsãlji him un trup sh-tuts him pãrtashi la unã singurã pãni.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Mutrits Israelul dupã trup. Nu suntu elji pãrtashi la altarlu, tsi mãcã curbãnsitili? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Tsi voi s-dzãc cu aestã? Cã curbãnsirea a idoljilor easti tsiva, icã idolu easti tsiva? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Nu, ma atseali tsi curbãnsescu pãngãnjlji, li curbãnsescu a demonjilor, nu a Dumnidzãlui sh-mini nu voi tsi voi s-vã fãtsets pãrtashi cu demonjlji. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Voi nu putets s-bets sh-cupa a Domnului sh-cupa a demonjilor. Voi nu putets s-loats parti sh-la measa a Domnului sh-la measa a demonjilor. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Nacã vrem s-fãtsem Domnul geloz? Nacã him ma vãrtoshi di elu?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libertatea a Pistimenlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Tuti suntu nvoljiti,” ma nu tuti aduc ufelii. “Tuti suntu nvoljiti,” ma nu tuti adar. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Vãrã s-nu caftã buna a lui, ma buna a alantului.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Mãcats itsido tsi s-vindi la ducheanea di carni, fãrã ntribari tsiva trã itia a conshtintsãljei, <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />cã, “a Domnului easti loclu sh-itsido tsi s-aflã pri nãsu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ps 24:1.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Macã vãrã nipistimen vã acljeami ti mãcari sh-voi vrets s-vã dutsets, imnats sh-mãcats itsido tsi vã bagã nãinti fãrã ntribari trã itia a conshtintsãljei. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ma macã vãrã vã dzãtsi: “Aestã mãcari easti curbãnsitã,” nu mãcats trã itia atsilui tsi vã spusi sh-trã itia a conshtintsãljei. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Sh-cãndu dzãc conshtintsa, nu dzãc di conshtintsa a ta, ma a alantului. Cã, cãtse s-giudicã libertatea a mea di conshtintsa a unui altu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Macã mini ljeau parti cu hãristisiri, cãtse s-mi ngiurã trã atsea trã cai mini hãristisescu?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Trã atsea, macã mãcats, macã bets, macã fãtsets altã tsiva, tuti fãtsets-li trã mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Nu vã fãtsets ncheadic nitsi trã Iudeilji, nitsi trã pãngãnjlji, nitsi trã bisearica a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Fãtsets ca mini tsi caftu s-mi arsescu a tutulor la itsido, nicãftãnda ufelia a mea, ma atsea a multsãlor tsi elji s-ascapã.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Fãtsets-vã imitatorlji a melji ashã di cum sh-mini escu imitatorlu a Hristolui.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Trã Anvãlearea a Caplui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Tora mini vã alavdu, cã mi adutsets aminti tu tuti lucrili sh-li tsãnets tuti adetsili ashã di cum vã li nvitsai. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ma voi tra si shtits cã caplu a cathiunui bãrbat easti Hristolu, caplu a muljeariljei easti bãrbatlu sh-caplu a Hristolui easti Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Cathi om tsi s-roagã icã prufitipseashti avãnda caplu anvãlit, arushineadzã caplu a lui. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Cathi muljeari tsi s-roagã icã prufitipseashti cu caplu dizvãlit arushineadzã caplu a ljei, cã easti unã soi ca unã muljeari cai ari sursitã caplu. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Macã unã muljeari nu anvãleashti caplu, atumtsea si s-tundã. Ma, macã ti unã muljeari easti arushãni si s-tundã icã surseascã caplu, atumtsea si anvãleascã. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Bãrbatlu nu prindi s-anvãleascã caplu, metsi easti icoana sh-mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui, iarã muljearea easti mãrirea a bãrbatlui. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Cã nu easti bãrbatu di la muljearea, ma muljearea easti di la bãrbatlu. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Nu s-featsi bãrbatlu ti muljearea, ma muljearea s-featsi ti bãrbatlu. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Trã aestã muljearea prindi s-aibã un semnu di autoritati pri cap trã itia a anghilor.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Cu tut atsea, tu Domnul, nitsi muljearea nu easti fãrã di bãrbatlu, nitsi bãrbatlu nu easti fãrã di muljearea. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Cã dupã cum muljearea yini di la bãrbatlu, ashã sh-bãrbatlu vini di la muljearea sh-tuti lucrili suntu di la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Giudicats voi singuri: Easti ghini ti unã muljeari si s-roagã a Dumnidzãlui cu caplu gol? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nu vã nveatsã sh-natura cã, macã un bãrbat alasã peri lundzi, easti arushãni trã nãsu, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />macã unã muljeari alasã peri lundzi, atsea easti tinjii ti nãsã? Cã perlji lundzi lji si deadirã a ljei ti anvãliri. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ma, macã vãrã va si s-facã ngrãnjaru, noi nu avem ahtar adeti sh-nitsi biseritsli a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsina a Domnului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Urnipsinda trã aestã, mini nu vã alavdã, cã voi vã adunats nu ti ghini, ma ti arãu. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Nãinti di tuti, cãndu voi vã adunats tu bisearicã, avdu cã ari dispãrtsãri namisa di voi sh-di unã parti pistipsescu. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Prindi s-aibã sh-mpãrtsãri namisa di voi tra si s-cunoascã atselji cai suntu aprovatsi. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Trã atsea, cãndu vã adunats la un loc, nu easti trã mãcari Tsina a Domnului, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />cã tu mãcari, cathiunu ljea ma nãinti tsina a lui sh-un ari foami, iarã alantu si mbeati. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Nacã nu avets casã ti mãcari sh-ti beari? Icã dispretsuits bisearica a Dumnidzãlui sh-rushinats atselji tsi nu au? Tsi s-vã dzãc? S-vã alavdu ti aestã? Nu vã alavdu.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Cã mini loai di la Domnul atsea tsi vã nvitsai sh-a voauã: Cã Domnul Isus tu noaptea tu cai s-vindu, lo pãni, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />sh-hãristisinda, u-frãmsi sh-dzãsi: “Aestu easti truplu a meu, tsi easti ti voi. Fãtsets aestã ti adutseari aminti mini.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Tutashã lo sh-cupa dupã tsinã dzãcãnda: “Aestã cupã easti pisti-ligãtura atsea noaua tu sãndzili a meu. Fãtsets aestã, di cãti ori va bets, ti adutseari aminti mini.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Cã di cãti ori voi mãcats aestã pãni sh-bets aestã cupã, voi dimãndats moartea a Domnului pãnã la vinita a lui.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ashãtsi-cã, caitsido tsi va mãcã aestã pãni sh-va bea cupa a Domnului ni axiusit, va s-hibã cãbatar a truplui sh-a sãndzilui a Domnului. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Ashãtsi cathiunu prindi si s-giudicã, sh-atumtsea s-mãcã di pãnea shi s-bea di cupa. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Atsel tsi mãcã sh-bea fãrã achicãsiri, mãcã sh-bea giudicata trã nãsu, cã nu cunoashti truplu a Domnului. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Trã aestã suntu ntrã voi multsã slaghi sh-lãndzits sh-multsã durnjirã. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Ma, ca s-nã mutream ghini, nu va nã giudicam. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Cãndu nã giudicãm di Domnul, nã ndridzem tra s-nu nã condamnãm deadun cu lumea.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Ashãtsi, frats sh-surãri, cãndu vã adunats ti mãcari, ashtiptats un-alantu. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Macã vãrã ari foami, s-mãcã la casã, tra s-nu vã adunats ti giudicari. Alantãli va li ndreg cãntsido tsi va yin.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Doari Duhuroasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Tora frats sh-surãri trã doarili duhuroasi, nu voi tsi s-hits nishtiuts. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Voi shtits cã, cãndu earats pãngãnji, vã trãdzeats dupã idolji muts sh-vã dutseats tu cãljuri strãmbi. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Trã atsea vã fac cunuscut cã vãrã tsi zburashti prit Duhlu a Dumnidzãlui nu dzãtsi: “Blãstimat s-hibã Isusul,” sh-vãrã nu poati s-dzãcã “Isusul easti Domnu,” dicãt mash prit Duhlu Sãmtu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Doarili suntu di tuti soili, ma Duhlu easti idyiul. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Suntu sh-multi soi di huzmitipsiri, ma Domnul easti idyiul. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Suntu sh-multi soi di lucri, ma Dumnidzãlu easti idyiul, cai li lucreadzã tuti tu tuts.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Sh-a cathiunui lji si da fãnirusirea a Duhlui trã ufelia a tutulor. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />A unui lji si da prit Duhlu un zbor di mintimenilji, a unui altu prit idyiul Duh lji si da un zbor di cunushteari, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />a unui altu prit idyiul Duh lji si da pisti, a unui altu prit idyiul Duh lji si da doarili ti vindicari, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />a unui altu lji si da puteari trã thavmati, a unui altu lji si da prufitsii, a unui altu lji si da alidzearea a duhurilor, a unui altu lji si da turlii di limbi sh-a unui altu lji si da tradutsearea a limbilor. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Sh-tuti aesti li lucreadzã singurlu sh-idyiul Duh, dãnda a cathiunui ashã dupã cum va elu.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Un Trup, Multi Mãdulari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Ashã ca truplu tsi easti un sh-ari multi mãdulari sh-tuti mãdularili a truplui, cu tutã cã suntu multi, suntu un trup singur, ashãtsi easti sh-cu Hristolu. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Cã sh-noi tuts nã pãtidzãm prit un idyiul Duh tra s-him un trup singur, cum Iudei cum Elinji, cum sclayi cum liberi, sh-a tutulor nã si deadi s-bem dit idyiul Duh.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Cã sh-truplu nu easti adrat di un mãdular, ma di multi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Macã va dzãtsea ciciorlu: “Metsi nu escu mãnã, nu escu mãdular a truplui,” vahi di aestã nu va s-hibã mãdular a truplui? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Macã va dzãtsea ureaclja: “Metsi nu escu ocljiu, nu escu mãdular a truplui,” vahi di aestã nu va s-hibã mãdular a truplui? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Macã tut truplu va s-eara ocljiu, iu va s-eara avdzãrea? Macã va s-eara tut avdzãri, iu va s-eara anjurdzirea? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Ma tora Dumnidzãlu li bãgã tuti mãdularili tu trup, cathiunã di eali unã dupã unã, ashã cum vru elu. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Macã va s-eara tuti un singur mãdular, iu va s-eara truplu? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Tora suntu dealihea multi mãdulari, ma un singur trup.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Ocljiul nu poati s-lji dzãcã a mãnãljei: “Nu am ananghi ti tini!” Icã caplu s-lã dzãcã a cicioarilor: “Nu am ananghi ti voi!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Din contra, mãdularili a truplui cai suntu ma slabi, suntu multi ma ananghioasi. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Iarã atseali tsi minduescu cã suntu nitinjisitili a truplui, atseali li anvãrteascã cu ma multã tinjii, sh-mãdularili a noastri ni aspusi au ma multã tinjii, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />ma mãdularili a noastri atseali mushati nu au ananghi trã aestã. Dumnidzãlu lu adrã truplu dãnda ma multã tinjii atsiljei parti tsi lji lipsea. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Ashãtsi nu va s-aibã dispãrtsãri tu trup sh-mãdularili va s-aibã cãshtiga ti un-alantu. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Macã un mãdular s-mundueashti, tuti mãdularili s-munduescu deadun, macã un mãdular s-tinjiseashti, tuti mãdularili s-hãrsescu deadun.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Voi hits truplu al Hristos, sh-cathiun di voi mãdularili a lui. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Sh-Dumnidzãlu bãgã tu bisearicã ma nãinti di tuts apostulji, a doaua prufitsilji, a treia nvitsãtorlji, deapoea faptili a thavmatilor, deapoea doarili di vindicari, agiutãrili, chivãrnisirea sh-turlii di limbi. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Nacã suntu tuts apostulji? Nacã suntu tuts prufits? Nacã suntu tuts nvitsãtori? Nacã fac tuts thavmati? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Nacã au tuts doari di vindicari? Nacã zburãscu tuts turlii di limbi? Nacã tuts traduc? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Cãftats cu zel doarili atseali ma buni. Mini ma vã aspunã unã cali cai easti ma scãntilioasã.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Vrearea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Macã va zburam pi limbili a oaminjlor, sh-a anghilor, shi s-nu aveam vreari, va s-earam faptã ca un bãcãr asunãtoarã, icã ca un tsimbal tsi agudeashti. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Macã va aveam darea a prufitsiiljei shi s-cunushteam tuti mistiryili sh-tutã shtintsa sh-ma s-aveam tutã pistea cãt s-mutam muntsãlji di loc, ma s-nu avem vreari, atumtsea nu va eram tsiva. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Sh-macã va u-mpãrtsam tutã avearea a mea, sh-macã va lu dãdeam truplu a meu tra s-mi alãvdam,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tu alti manuscrisi easti “s-ardã”.</char></note> macã nu va aveam vreari, nu va nji axizea tsiva.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Vrearea ari arãvdari, easti bunã, nu ari zilii, vrearea nu s-alavdã, nu s-pirifãnseashti, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />nu s-aspunã nitinjisitã, nu caftã a ljei, nu s-nivriseashti aĝonjea, nu lugurseashti arãulu, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />nu s-hãrseashti di nindriptatea, ma s-hãrseashti di alihea, <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />tuti li anvãleashti, tuti li pistipseashti, tuti li nãdãeashti sh-tuti li aravdi.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Vrearea pute nu cadi nghios, ma macã ari prufitsii, ea va s-bitiseascã, macã ari limbi, eali va pãpseascã, macã ari shtintsã, ea va s-afãniseascã. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Cã noi cunushtem putsãn sh-prufitipsim putsãn, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />ma cãndu s-yinã atsea cai easti perfectã, atsea tsi easti partsialã va s-bitiseascã. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Cãndu earam cilimean, zburam ca cilimean, mindueam ca cilimean, giudicam ca cilimean. Ghini-ma, cãndu mi feciu bãrbat, s-bitisirã atseali njicuramili. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Cã tora videm ca prit unã videalã nicuratã, ma atumtsea va li videm tuti tu oclji. Tora cunoscu putsãn, ma atumtsea va cunoscu ntreg, ashã di cum escu cunuscut.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Tora armãn aesti trei: pistea, nãdia sh-vrearea. Ma marea di aesti easti vrearea.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Doarili a Prufitsiiljei sh-a Limbilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Urmats vrearea sh-cãftats doarili duhuroasi, ma ma multu s-prufitipsits. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Cã atsel cai zburashti tu unã limbã, nu zburashti cu oaminjlji ma cu Dumnidzãlu, cã vãrã nu lu aducheashti, ma prit Duh zburashti lucri mistiryioasi. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Iarã atsel cai prufitipseashti, lã zburashti a oaminjlor trã adrari, trã inimusiri sh-trã diznjirdari. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Atsel tsi zburashti tu unã limbã, s-adari idyiul elu, ma atsel tsi prufitipseashti, adari unã bisearicã ntreagã. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Mini vream tsi tuts si zburãts tu alti limbi, ma ma multu voi s-prufitipsits. Atsel tsi prufitipseashti easti ma mari di atsel cai zburashti tu alti limbi, dicãt mash cãndu tradutsi tsi bisearica si s-adarã.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Macã mini yin la voi, frats sh-surãri, zburãnda tu alti limbi, tsi ufelii va vã adutseam, ma s-nu vã zburam cu discupiriri icã cu cunushteari, cu prufitsii icã cu nvitsãturã? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Tut ashã sh-instrumentili di muzicã fãrã banã cum flueara icã harpa cai suneadzã, ma s-nu da tonuri soi di soi, cum va s-cunoascã melodia di fluearã di melodia di harpã? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Sh-trumpeta macã nu va da unã boatsi curatã, cum va s-etimãseascã suldatslji ti alumtã? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Ashãtsi sh-voi, ma s-nu dats prit limbã unã zbor curat, cum va s-aducheascã atsea tsi s-greashti? Va s-hits zburãnda di-vãnat. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Suntu multi soi di limbi tu lumi sh-vãrã di eali nu easti ni-achicãsit. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Atumtsea, macã nu aduchescu tsi dzãc zboarili, mini va s-hiu ca xen ti atsel tsi zburashti sh-atsel tsi zburashti va hibã ca xen ti mini. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Ashãtsi sh-voi metsi hits mplin di zel cãtrã doarili a Duhlui, cãftats tra s-hits artirsits tu ea trã adrarea a bisearicãljei.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Trã atsea atsel tsi zburashti tu unã altã limbã, si s-roagã s-traducã tsi dzãtsi. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Cã mãcã mi rog pi unã altã limbã, duhlu a meu s-roagã, ma mintea a mea easti nifructoasã. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Tsi prindi s-fac atumtsea? Va mi rog cu duhlu, ma va mi rog sh-cu mintea, va s-psãltisescu cu duhlu, ma va s-psãltisescu sh-cu mintea. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Cu alti zboari, macã ghinicuvintedz mash cu Duh, atsel cai easti tu loclu a nivintsatlui, cum va dzãc “Amin” ti hãristisirea a ta, macã nu aduchi tsi dzãtsesh tini? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Tini dealihea hãristiseshti ghini, ma alantu nu s-nvãrtuseashti.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Mini hãristisescu Dumnidzãlu cã zburãscu tu alti limbi ma multã di voi, <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />ma tu bisearicã ma ghini dzãc tsintsi zboari cu minti aduchiti tra s-nvets sh-alantsã, dicãt dzatsi njilji di zboari pi altã limbã. <verse eid="1CO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Frats sh-surãri, nu vã fãtsets cilimenji di minti, fãtsets-vã ca cilimenji njitsi cãtrã arãulu, ma di minti fãtsets-vã coptsã. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Tu Lege easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Va lji zburãscu a popului aishtui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">cu altã limbã sh-cu alti budzã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">ma sh-ashãtsi nu va mi ascultã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">dzãsi Domnul.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Ashãtsi cã limbili suntu ca seamni nu ti atselji cai pistipsescu, ma ti atselji cai nu pistipsescu, iarã prufitsia easti ti atselji cai pistipsescu, nu ti atselji cai nu pistipsescu. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Trã atsea, macã va s-adunã bisearica tu un loc sh-tuts si zburascã pi alti limbi shi s-intrã nivintsats icã nipistimenji, nu va dzãc cã hits zurlji? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Iarã ma s-prufitipseascã tuts shi s-intrã vãrã nipistimen icã vãrã nivintsat, va si s-cãbãteadzã ti amãrtii di tuts sh-va si s-giudicã di tuts tsi avdã. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Ascumtili a inimãljei a lui va s-easã tu padi sh-ashãtsi cãdzãnda pri dintsã mpadi va s-alavdã Dumnidzãlu dimãndãnda: “Dealihea Dumnidzãlu easti namisa di voi!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alãvdari Arãdãpsitã tu Bisearicã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Atumtsea tsi prindi s-fãtsem, frats sh-surãri? Cãndu s-nã adunãm, cathiunu di voi tsi ari un psalmu, icã unã nvitsãturã, ari unã discupiriri, ari unã limbã nicunuscutã, ari unã tradutseari, tuti prindi si s-facã ti adrarea a bisearicãljei. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Macã vãrã zburashti pi unã altã limbã, si s-facã di doi icã di trei oaminji cu aradha sh-un s-traducã. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ma, macã nu easti vãrã traducãtor, elu prindi s-pãpseascã tu bisearicã shi si zburascã cu mintea a lui sh-cu Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Si zburascã doi icã trei prufitsi sh-alantsãlji s-giudicã atsea tsi s-dzãtsi. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ma macã si discupirã tsiva a unui altu cai sheadi, protlu s-tacã. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Cã tuts un cãti un putets s-prufitipsits, cu nãeti tsi tuts s-nveatsã sh-tuts s-inimuseascã. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Duhurili a prufitsilor suntu sumbãgati a prufitsilor. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Dumnidzãlu nu easti Dumnidzãlu a mintituriljei, ma a paciljei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Ashã cum easti tu tuti biseritsli a popului al Domnu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />muljerili s-tacã pri biseritsi, cã eali nu prindi si zburascã, ma prindi si sumbagã, ashã dupã cum dzãtsi sh-legea. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Macã vor s-nveatsã tsiva, s-ntreabã la casã bãrbatslji a lor, cã easti ti rushini ti unã muljeari sã zburascã tu bisearicã.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Nacã di la voi ishi zborlu a Dumnidzãlui? Icã mash la voi agiumsi? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Macã vãrã mindueashti cã easti prufit icã duhuros, prindi s-aducheascã cã aesti tsi ma vã scriu easti dimãndãciunea a Domnului. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ma macã vãrã nu li cunoashti, elu s-nu si s-cunoascã! <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Trã atsea, frats sh-surãri, cãftats ma multu s-prufitipsits sh-nu nchidicats zburarea pi alti limbi. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Tuti prindi si s-facã cu lizeti sh-cu aradha.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Nyearea a Hristolui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Tora, frats sh-surãri, ma vã fac cunuscut evanghelu tsi vã dimãndai cai voi loat sh-tu cai stats. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Prit atsel evanghelu voi vã ascãpats, macã va tsãnets zborlu tsi vã dimãndai, mash macã pistipsit vãnat.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Cã mini vã ded a voauã, nãinti di tuti, atsea tsi sh-mini u loai: Hristolu muri ti amãrtiili a noastri dupã Scriturili, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />s-ngrupã, shi s-nyie a treia dzuã dupã Scriturili, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />si aspusi al Chefa sh-apoea a doisprãdzatsilor. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Deapoea si aspusi di unã oarã singur la ma multsã di tsintsi suti di frats sh-surãri, di la cai ma multsãlji bãneadzã sh-tora, ma niscãntsã murirã. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ma napoi si aspusi al Iacov sh-ma napoi a tuts apostuljilor. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Tu bitisitã nji si aspusi sh-a njia, ca a unui amintat nãinti di chirolu tsi prindi.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Cã mini escu ma njiclu a apostuljilor, tsi nu escu axiu s-mi acljem apostul, metsi priaĝunii bisearica a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ma prit harul al Dumnidzãu escu atsel tsi escu, sh-harul a lui cãtrã mini nu easti vãnat. Di contra, am lucratã ma multu dicãt elji tuts, cu tutã atsea nu mini, ma harul a Dumnidzãlui easti cu mini. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Ashãtsi cum mini, cum elji, predicãm sh-voi tuts ashãtsi pistipsitã.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyearea a Mortsãlor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Macã Hristolu s-preadicã cã easti nyeat dit mortsã, cum niscãntsã di voi dzãc cã nu ari nyeari dit mortsã? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ma macã nu ari nyeari dit mortsã, atumtsea nitsi Hristolu nu easti nyeat. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Sh-macã Hristolu nu easti nyeat, atumtsea di-vãnat easti predicarea a noastrã, di-vãnat easti sh-pistea a voastrã. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Ashãtsi sh-noi him martiri arãdioshi ti Dumnidzãlu, cã mãrtirsim ti Dumnidzãu cã nyie Hristolu, cai nu lu nyie, macã dealihea mortsãlji nu s-nyeadzã. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Cã, macã mortsãlji nu s-nyeadzã, atumtsea nitsi Hristolu nu s-nyie. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Sh-macã Hristolu nu easti nyeat, pistea a voastrã easti di-vãnat, sh-voi hits ninga tu amãrtiili a voastri. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Atumtsea sh-atselji tsi murirã tu Hristolu au chirutã. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Macã avem nãdãit tu Hristolu mash ti aestã banã, atumtsea him ma mãratsã di tuts oaminjlji.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ma tora Hristolu easti nyeat dit mortsã sh-easti protlu frut atsilor cai au murit. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Cã, metsi prit un om vini moartea, sh-nyearea a mortsãlor yini prit un om. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Cã ashã cum tu Adam tuts mor, ashã sh-tu Hristolu tuts va si nyeadzã, <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />tuts dupã arada: protlu frut Hristolu, deapoea tu vinita a lui atselji tsi suntu a Hristolui. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Deapoea yini bitisita, cãndu elu s-lji-u da amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu Tatãl, cãndu s-aibã afãnisit cathi printsipatã, cathi autoritati sh-cathi fuchii. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Cã prindi elu s-amirãreascã pãnã cãndu s-lji bagã tuts dushmanjlji sum cicioarili a lui. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Dushmanlu di soni tsi va hibã afãnisit, easti moartea. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Cã Dumnidzãlu “lji bãgã tuts sum cicioarili a lui.” Ma cãndu s-dzãtsi “tuti” suntu sumbãgati, si shtii fãrã di altã nu Dumnidzãlu, atsel cai tu Hristolu lji sumbãgã tuti. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Cãndu s-lji hibã sumbãgati tuti a lui, atumtsea sh-Hiljilu va lji si sumbagã a Tatãlui, atsel tsi lji li sumbãgã tuti, tsi Dumnidzãlu s-hibã itsido la tuti.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Altã soi, tsi va s-facã atselji cai s-pãteadzã trã mortsãlji? Macã mortsãlji nu s-nyeadzã dip, atumtsea cãtse s-pãteadzã trã elji? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Cãtse noi him tu piricljiu cathi oarã? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Cathi dzuã mini mor, ashã cum dealihea mi alavdu trã voi, frats sh-surãri, tu Hristolu Isus Domnul a nostru. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Macã mini ca om mi alumtai cu agrinjili tu Efes, tsi ufelii avui? Macã mortsãlji nu s-nyeadzã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">“Haidi s-mãcãm shi s-bem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">cã mãni va murim.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 22:13.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nu vã arãdets: “Sutsãtili atseali arali aspargu adetsili atseali buni.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Minduits-vã ashã cum prindi sh-nu amãrtisits ma, cã niscãntsã nu au cunushtearea a Dumnidzãlui. Ti arushinea a voastrã u dzãc aestã.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyearea a Truplui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Ma vãrã va dzãcã: “Cum s-nyeadzã mortsãlji sh-cu tsi trup va yin?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />O lai zurlu! Tsi seaminji tini, nu yini tu banã, macã nu moari ma nãinti. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Sh-cãndu seaminji tini, nu seaminji truplu cai va si s-facã, ma un gãrnuts dispuljeat, vahi grãn icã vãrã altã simintsã. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ma Dumnidzãlu lji da a simintsãljei un trup, ashã cum vru elu sh-a cathiunei simintsã un trup a ljei. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Nu easti cathi trup idyiul: altu easti truplu a omlui, altu easti truplu a prãvdzãlor, altu easti truplu a puljilor, sh-altu easti truplu a peshtilor. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Suntu trupuri tsereshti sh-trupuri di loc, ma altã easti strãlutsirea atsilor dit tser sh-altã atsilor dit loc. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Altã easti strãlutsirea a soarilui, altã easti strãlutsirea a lunãljei, sh-altã easti strãlutsirea a stealilor, cã steaua di steaua s-aleadzi di strãlutsirea.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ashã easti sh-nyearea a mortsãlor. Truplu si seaminã tu aspãrdzeari sh-va s-nyeadzã tu niaspãrdzeari. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Si seaminã tu nitinjii shi s-nyeadzã tu mãriri, si seaminã tu slãbintsã shi s-nyeadzã tu fuchii. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Si seaminã trup natural shi si nyeadzã trup duhuros. Macã ari trup natural, ari sh-trup duhuros. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ashãtsi sh-easti scriatã: “Protlu om Adamlu s-featsi suflit yiu,” iarã Adamlu dit soni s-featsi Duh tsi da banã. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Nu fu duhuroslu atsel di prota, ma fu atsel naturalu, sh-deapoea duhuroslu. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Omlu atsel di prota eara faptã di loc.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahr 2:7.</char></note> Omlu atsel a doilu easti dit tser. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ashã cum easti atsel dit loc, suntu sh-atselji dit loc. Ashã cum easti atsel tserescu, suntu sh-atselji tsereshti. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ashã cum purtãm icoana atsilui dit loc, ashã va s-purtãm sh-icoana atsilui tserescu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Tora ma vã dzãc aestã, frats sh-surãri: Carnea sh-sãndzili nu pot s-mushtineadzã Amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui sh-nitsi aspãrdzearea nu poati s-mushtineadzã niaspãrdzearea. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ia, ma vã aspun un mistiryiu: Tuts nu va murim, ma tuts va nã alãxim, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />dinãoarã, cãt s-ncljidz shi s-discljidz ocljilji la trumpeta di soni. Cã va batã trumpeta sh-mortsãlji va s-nyeadzã niaspartsã sh-noi va nã alãxim. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Cã prindi tsi aestu trup cai s-aspardzi si nveascã cu niaspãrdzeari, sh-aestu trup muritor si nveascã cu nimuritor. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Cãndu aestu trup cai s-aspardzi si nveascã cu niaspãrdzeari sh-aestu muritorlu si nveascã cu nimuritorlu, atumtsea va s-undzeascã zborlu tsi easti dzãsã: “Moartea s-ascãpitã di nichisirea.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 25:8.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“O lea moarti, iu easti nichisirea a ta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">O lea moarti, iu easti schinlu a tãu?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hos 13:14. </char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Schinlu a moartiljei easti amãrtia, sh-fuchia a amãrtiiljei easti Legea. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ma, s-hãristisim Dumnidzãlu cai nã da nichisirea prit Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Trã atsea, frats sh-surãri a melji vruts, s-hits vãrtoshi sh-nu vã minats, adãvgãnda totãna tu lucrul al Domnu shi shtinda cã lucrarea a voastrã nu easti fãrã hãiri tu Domnul.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Agiutãrili a Popului al Dumnidzã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Tora cãt ti adunarea a agiutãrilor trã oaminjlji al Dumnidzãlu, ashãtsi dupã cum urnipsii biseritsli tu Galatia, ashãtsi fãtsets sh-voi. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Tu cathi prota dzuã a sãptãmãnãljei cathiunu di voi s-bagã dinãparti tsiva, ahãntu cãtã poati, tra s-nu adunã agiutãrili cãndu s-yin mini. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Sh-cãndu s-hiu atsia, atselji tsi va arãdãpsits voi, mini va lji pitrec cu cãrtsã tra s-ducã doara a voastrã la Ierusalem. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Ma s-hibã ghini tra s-mi duc sh-mini, atumtsea elji va yinã deadun cu mini.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Va yin la voi dupã tsi s-trec prit Machidunii (cã va s-trec prit Machidunii). <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Vahi va stau cu voi, poati cã va earnedz, tsi voi s-mi pitritsets iutsido iu va mi duc. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Cã nu voi s-vã ved ashã ca tu tricut, nãdãescu s-armãn putsãn chiro cu voi, cu vrearea a Domnului. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />La Efes va armãn pãnã tu Pentecostã, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />cã nji si easti discljisã unã ushi mari sh-fructoasã ti lucru, shi ncuntrãtorlji suntu multsã. <verse eid="1CO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Cãndu va yinã Timoteul, cãshtigats-vã tra sta la voi fãrã fricã, cã fatsi lucrul a Domnului ashãtsi ca mini. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Trã atsea s-nu lu atimuseascã vãrã, ma pitritseats-lu tu pace s-yin la mini, cã lu ashteptu cu fratslji.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Cãt ti fratili Apollo, lji feciu multu rigeai s-yinea la voi cu fratslji, ma nu vru dip s-yinea tora, ma va s-yinã cãndu va s-aibã chiro.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Vigljeats, stats niminat tu pisti, bãrbãtats-vã sh-nvãrtushits-vã. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Fãtsets-li tuti cu vreari. <verse eid="1CO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Tora vã urnipsescu, frats sh-surãri, voi u-cunushtets Fumealja al Stefanu, tsi easti protlu frut tu Ahaia. Elji si arãdãpsirã la huzmitipsirea a oaminjlor al Dumnidzãlu, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />tsi sh-voi s-vã sumbãgats aishtor sh-a cathiunui cai lucreadzã shi s-cãpãeashti deadun cu nãshi. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Sh-mi hãrsescu di vinita al Stefan, al Fortunatu sh-al Achaicu, cã elji mplinirã atsea tsi lipsea la voi. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Cã elji ntinirarã duhlu a meu sh-duhlu a vostru, trã atsea s-lji tinjisits ahtãri oaminji.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salutãri di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Vã da sãnãtati biseritsli tu Asii. Vã da multu sãnãtati tu Domnul, Acuila sh-Prishila, deadun cu bisearica tsi s-adunã la casa a lor. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Vã da sãnãtati tuts fratslji sh-surãrili. Dats sãnãtati la un-alantu cu unã bãshari sãmtã. <verse eid="1CO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Urarea aestã easti cu mãna a mea, al Pavlu. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Macã vãrã nu lu va Domnul, blãstimat s-hibã! Marana-tha!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Domnul a nostru, haidi!</char></note><verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Harul a Domnului Isus s-hibã cu voi! <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Vrearea a mea s-hibã cu voi tuts tu Hristolu Isus! Amin!<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>